  "prefLabel": "Ed 1021.02 Notification of Right to Mediation and Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1021.02 Notification of Right to Mediation and Hearings.\n\n(a) The NHVR shall provide an individual or, as appropriate, the individual's representative, notice as enumerated in 34 CFR 361.57(b)(1).\n\n(b) The notice required in Ed 1021.04(a) shall be provided by using the appropriate mode of communication consistent with the requirements of 34 CFR 361.57(b)(2).\n\n(c) Determinations for which a review may be requested include the NHVR’s failure to release harmful information directly to the individual.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1000.html"
